{"method":{"methodHash":"3fccbf422533894626352c959927f4df","typeHash":"2ca9d5d2b01a9292fa204f5df7b8e46f","name":"CalculateNumDetections","filePath":"/Users/pratiksinghthakur/perproj/dotnet/Aimmy/Aimmy2/AILogic/MathUtil.cs","bodySpan":{"startLine":61,"startColumn":9,"endLine":69,"endColumn":10},"calls":[]},"lines":["        public static int CalculateNumDetections(int imageSize)","        {","            // YOLOv8 detection calculation: (size/8)\u00B2 \u002B (size/16)\u00B2 \u002B (size/32)\u00B2","            int stride8 = imageSize / 8;","            int stride16 = imageSize / 16;","            int stride32 = imageSize / 32;","","            return (stride8 * stride8) \u002B (stride16 * stride16) \u002B (stride32 * stride32);","        }"],"startLine":61}